# rows_pick_ctr substituted a constructor row's whole sub-pattern for
# its column variable (patt_term(p0)), so a match over N Nat literals
# rebuilt patterns of depth up to N for every surviving row at every
# level: cubic, and 1000 literal cases took 17 s to flatten. the
# substitute is now the constructor over the column's field variables,
# the term the variable row already used; the field rows refine it as
# their columns come up. 500 literal rows plus a 1n+p row flatten and
# run alike on every lane
import Base

